- Eviction policies with hot/not-hot page discrimination
- CAS-based synchronization to avoid double-eviction
- Reclaim throttling to prevent stalls

## Code Example

```c
// Minimal eviction decision sketch
struct page *select_victim(struct mem_node *nodes, int node_count) {
  struct page *victim = NULL;
  int best_score = INT_MAX;
  for (int i = 0; i < node_count; i++) {
    // scan candidate pages on node i, prefer non-hot, remote pages
    struct page *p = first_candidate_on_node(nodes[i]);
    if (!p) continue;
    int score = score_page(p); // lower = better to evict
    if (score < best_score) { victim = p; best_score = score; }
  }
  return victim;
}
``` 

